Subject: The best smooth function for the temporal component
Message-ID: <b2ZQnmjPnMQ.T2UQKco6ItMJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/b2ZQnmjPnMQ/m/T2UQKco6ItMJ>
